{"id":"d26f8820bf776b8c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-syntactic-proof-system.md","title":"Finite-premise syntactic proof systems","display":"df-syntactic-proof-system — Finite-premise syntactic proof systems","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-syntactic-proof-system","aliases":["72-df-syntactic-proof-system"],"display":"df-syntactic-proof-system — Finite-premise syntactic proof systems","depends_on":["[[72-df-first-order-formula]]","[[72-df-free-variable]]","[[72-df-substitution-formula]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local reconstruction of the interface required by the supplied book-72 files","source_kind":"local-reconstruction","verification_status":"local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-syntactic-proof-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-syntactic-proof-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-syntactic-proof-system — Finite-premise syntactic proof systems"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2c943d760d42086b\" href=\"?note=2c943d760d42086b\" title=\"72-df-first-order-formula\">72-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdc2c33e939db2f8\" href=\"?note=fdc2c33e939db2f8\" title=\"72-df-free-variable\">72-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bab190ea1c0904c8\" href=\"?note=bab190ea1c0904c8\" title=\"72-df-substitution-formula\">72-df-substitution-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local reconstruction of the interface required by the supplied book-72 files"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-reconstruction"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为有效一阶语言或签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X:=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(U)\">\\(X:=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(U)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:=\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(V:=\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>。语法、全称闭包和代入分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2c943d760d42086b\" href=\"?note=2c943d760d42086b\" title=\"72-df-first-order-formula\">72-df-first-order-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fdc2c33e939db2f8\" href=\"?note=fdc2c33e939db2f8\" title=\"72-df-free-variable\">72-df-free-variable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bab190ea1c0904c8\" href=\"?note=bab190ea1c0904c8\" title=\"72-df-substitution-formula\">72-df-substitution-formula</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq X\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\\times X\">\\(\\mathcal R\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\\times X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\langle X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal R\\rangle\">\\(P=\\langle X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal R\\rangle\\)</span>。规则实例第一分量是有限有序前提族，不包含假设解除机制。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in X\">\\(A,B\\in X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span> 在本文件缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\lor B\">\\(\\neg A\\lor B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U\">\\(K_U\\)</span> 把原子和整个全称公式视为命题赋值输入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{K_U}\">\\(v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{K_U}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,U):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal A\\subseteq X\\ \\exists\\mathcal R\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\\times X\\ (P=\\langle X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal R\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,U):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal A\\subseteq X\\ \\exists\\mathcal R\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\\times X\\ (P=\\langle X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal R\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nK_U&amp;:=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(U)\\cup\\{\\forall xA:x\\in V\\land A\\in X\\},\\\\\nb_v(D)&amp;:=v(D)\\quad(D\\in K_U),\\quad b_v(\\neg A):=1-b_v(A),\\quad b_v(A\\lor B):=\\max(b_v(A),b_v(B)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PTaut}_U&amp;:=\\{A\\in X:\\forall v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{K_U}\\ b_v(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LogAx}_U&amp;:=\\operatorname{PTaut}_U\\cup\\{\\forall xA\\to A[t/x]:A\\in X\\land x\\in V\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):A,B\\in X\\land x\\in V\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}_U(A)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EqAx}_U&amp;:=\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{s\\doteq t\\to(A[s/x]\\to A[t/x]):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\\land A\\in X\\land x\\in V\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LogRules}_U&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle A,A\\to B\\rangle,B\\rangle:A,B\\in X\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle A\\rangle,\\forall xA\\rangle:A\\in X\\land x\\in V\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FOL}_U&amp;:=\\langle X,\\operatorname{LogAx}_U,\\operatorname{LogRules}_U\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U&amp;:=\\langle X,\\operatorname{LogAx}_U\\cup\\operatorname{EqAx}_U,\\operatorname{LogRules}_U\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nK_U&amp;:=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(U)\\cup\\{\\forall xA:x\\in V\\land A\\in X\\},\\\\\nb_v(D)&amp;:=v(D)\\quad(D\\in K_U),\\quad b_v(\\neg A):=1-b_v(A),\\quad b_v(A\\lor B):=\\max(b_v(A),b_v(B)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PTaut}_U&amp;:=\\{A\\in X:\\forall v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{K_U}\\ b_v(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LogAx}_U&amp;:=\\operatorname{PTaut}_U\\cup\\{\\forall xA\\to A[t/x]:A\\in X\\land x\\in V\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):A,B\\in X\\land x\\in V\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}_U(A)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EqAx}_U&amp;:=\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{s\\doteq t\\to(A[s/x]\\to A[t/x]):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\\land A\\in X\\land x\\in V\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LogRules}_U&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\langle A,A\\to B\\rangle,B\\rangle:A,B\\in X\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle A\\rangle,\\forall xA\\rangle:A\\in X\\land x\\in V\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FOL}_U&amp;:=\\langle X,\\operatorname{LogAx}_U,\\operatorname{LogRules}_U\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U&amp;:=\\langle X,\\operatorname{LogAx}_U\\cup\\operatorname{EqAx}_U,\\operatorname{LogRules}_U\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一般SyntacticProofSystem仅是句法演算的结构谓词，不把可靠性、完备性或多项式时间检查暗加为假设。后两式另外给出可供72内部复用的经典一阶演算，并明确区别是否加入相等公理。逻辑公理的命题部分可由有限布尔赋值检查；没有以全部一阶有效式作公理。对额外假设使用概括规则时，后续可证性接口要求这些假设都是句子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2c943d760d42086b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"fdc2c33e939db2f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"bab190ea1c0904c8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2c943d760d42086b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U$ 为有效一阶语言或签名，$X:=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(U)$，$V:=\\mathrm{Var}_S$。语法、全称闭包和代入分别取 [[72-df-first-order-formula]]、[[72-df-free-variable]]、[[72-df-substitution-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"fdc2c33e939db2f8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U$ 为有效一阶语言或签名，$X:=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(U)$，$V:=\\mathrm{Var}_S$。语法、全称闭包和代入分别取 [[72-df-first-order-formula]]、[[72-df-free-variable]]、[[72-df-substitution-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"bab190ea1c0904c8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U$ 为有效一阶语言或签名，$X:=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(U)$，$V:=\\mathrm{Var}_S$。语法、全称闭包和代入分别取 [[72-df-first-order-formula]]、[[72-df-free-variable]]、[[72-df-substitution-formula]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"X:=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(U)","display":false},{"tex":"V:=\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R\\subseteq X^{<\\omega}\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"P=\\langle X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\lor B","display":false},{"tex":"K_U","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{K_U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,U):\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal A\\subseteq X\\ \\exists\\mathcal R\\subseteq X^{<\\omega}\\times X\\ (P=\\langle X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal R\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nK_U&:=\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(U)\\cup\\{\\forall xA:x\\in V\\land A\\in X\\},\\\\\nb_v(D)&:=v(D)\\quad(D\\in K_U),\\quad b_v(\\neg A):=1-b_v(A),\\quad b_v(A\\lor B):=\\max(b_v(A),b_v(B)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PTaut}_U&:=\\{A\\in X:\\forall v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{K_U}\\ b_v(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LogAx}_U&:=\\operatorname{PTaut}_U\\cup\\{\\forall xA\\to A[t/x]:A\\in X\\land x\\in V\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall x(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):A,B\\in X\\land x\\in V\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}_U(A)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EqAx}_U&:=\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{s\\doteq t\\to(A[s/x]\\to A[t/x]):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(U)\\land A\\in X\\land x\\in V\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{LogRules}_U&:=\\{\\langle\\langle A,A\\to B\\rangle,B\\rangle:A,B\\in X\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle A\\rangle,\\forall xA\\rangle:A\\in X\\land x\\in V\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FOL}_U&:=\\langle X,\\operatorname{LogAx}_U,\\operatorname{LogRules}_U\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U&:=\\langle X,\\operatorname{LogAx}_U\\cup\\operatorname{EqAx}_U,\\operatorname{LogRules}_U\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3007,"backlinks":[{"id":"c42b7f1faaf95a1c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,U)$、$P=\\langle X,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal R\\rangle$ 与 $\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_U$ 取 [[72-df-syntactic-proof-system]]。$\\Gamma\\subseteq X$，$\\tau\\in X$，$\\pi\\in X^{<\\omega}$；序列从0编号。"},{"id":"ca39c110894da886","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,\\Sigma)$